# 基本文章編集から運び出したものを、デスクトップの文章編集とプロセスの文章編集で同じにする
# (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py. A document of one line, opened as 受け先 with no object
# behind it, is moved by its name band to the right of the screen. A copy of 基本文章編集 whose
# record 0 is the text below (xmlbig) is opened at 100,100: a line, a line with a bold word and a
# red word, a figure standing in a line, and a last line. Carried by the hand, the button let go
# at once each time:
#   1. 太字の語と赤い語, picked, out of the window onto 受け先: they go in there as they looked
#      (the process hands them on as a fragment in the tray's place of its own, DT_F_FRAG)
#   2. 先頭, picked, out of the window and back onto the end of the last line: they move there
#      (the desktop answers the process DT_F_BACK, and it moves them within its text)
#   3. the figure, out of the window and back onto the end of the last line: it moves there
#   4. the figure, from there onto 受け先: it goes in there where the hand let go, and leaves
#      the copy (DT_F_FRAG without DT_F_TEXT)
# Record 0 of the copy, saved, and the record of the one the letters went into (sum keys) are the
# same, byte for byte, whichever editor carried them; 受け先2, made as 受け先 and put over it, is
# the one for the process.
# Keys: Ctrl+S 16 01, Ctrl+E 08 01.
docproc kernel
xml <tad version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"><document><text lang="0" bpat="0"/>
xml <p>受け先の行</p>
xml </document></tad>
xmlopen 受け先
wait 500
drag 300 75 1000 395
wait 500
mkbig doc 3
xml <tad version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"><document><text lang="0" bpat="0"/>
xml <p>先頭の行です。</p>
xml <p>前<bold>太字の語</bold>と<font color="#ff0000">赤い語</font>の後</p>
xml <p>A<figure><figView left="10" top="10" right="110" bottom="50"/><figDraw left="10" top="10" right="110" bottom="50"/><rect l_pat="1" left="10" top="10" right="110" bottom="50"/></figure>B</p>
xml <p>最後の行です。</p>
xml </document></tad>
xmlbig
open big
waitwin 基本文章編集 600
sync 600
wait 500
drag 125 175 240 175
sync 600
hold 160 175
move 300 200
move 600 300
move 800 420
move 900 450
up
sync 600
wait 300
sum show keys
keep kernel_to
click 400 112
sync 600
drag 111 139 140 139
sync 600
hold 120 139
move 300 200
move 750 200
move 400 260
move 300 270
up
sync 600
wait 300
hold 160 225
move 300 260
move 750 300
move 400 280
move 300 272
up
sync 600
wait 300
hold 280 255
move 400 300
move 750 400
move 1000 500
up
sync 600
wait 300
sum show keys
keep kernel_to2
click 400 112
sync 600
key 16 01
sync 600
sum show
keep kernel
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
xml <tad version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"><document><text lang="0" bpat="0"/>
xml <p>受け先の行</p>
xml </document></tad>
xmlopen 受け先2
wait 500
drag 300 75 1000 395
wait 500
mkbig doc 3
xml <tad version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"><document><text lang="0" bpat="0"/>
xml <p>先頭の行です。</p>
xml <p>前<bold>太字の語</bold>と<font color="#ff0000">赤い語</font>の後</p>
xml <p>A<figure><figView left="10" top="10" right="110" bottom="50"/><figDraw left="10" top="10" right="110" bottom="50"/><rect l_pat="1" left="10" top="10" right="110" bottom="50"/></figure>B</p>
xml <p>最後の行です。</p>
xml </document></tad>
xmlbig
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 4
wait 800
logmark
drag 125 175 240 175
expectsince document: drew
wait 300
logmark
hold 160 175
move 300 200
move 600 300
move 800 420
move 900 450
up
expectsincein 10 document: letters carried out (0)
wait 500
sum show keys
same kernel_to
logmark
click 400 112
wait 300
logmark
drag 111 139 140 139
expectsince document: drew
wait 300
logmark
hold 120 139
move 300 200
move 750 200
move 400 260
move 300 270
up
expectsincein 10 back here
wait 500
logmark
hold 160 225
move 300 260
move 750 300
move 400 280
move 300 272
up
expectsincein 10 document: figure carried out
wait 500
logmark
hold 280 255
move 400 300
move 750 400
move 1000 500
up
expectsincein 10 document: figure carried out (0)
wait 500
sum show keys
same kernel_to2
logmark
click 400 112
wait 300
logmark
key 16 01
expectsince document: saved (0)
sum show
same kernel
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince document: closed
wait 500
